  id: theoldgrey
  displayName: The Old Grey
  description: 'Seven strokes, a wolf''s head, then nothing. A pack still runs from the den north-east of the tower, and the old one at its head is the one the watch fled: grey to the muzzle, bigger than any wolf should be. Eirik calls it the Old Grey.'
  chain: Eirik
  journalNotes: 'The Wolf Den lies about 75 m north-east of the Ruined Watchtower, back toward home. The Old Grey is bigger and stronger than any of its pack: come ready.'
